  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31435394",
      "title": "Confirming Picked Locations",
      "lectureOrder": 206,
      "videoOrder": 200,
      "sourceHash": "ae8b4a13490953e1746d2bbbacf2692286a530a01e3f56722053ff3e716511f3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.8,
          "en": "So let's start with adding IcanButton",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 6.61,
          "en": "to the header, that allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.61,
          "end": 9.31,
          "en": "to save and confirm a location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.31,
          "end": 12.17,
          "en": "So let's make sure we can confirm a chose location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.17,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "And for this I will add a new function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 18.91,
          "en": "to my map screen component, and I'll name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.91,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "this function savePickedLocationHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 28.23,
          "en": "This function should be executed once a to be added button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.23,
          "end": 30.393,
          "en": "in our header was clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.71,
          "end": 34.55,
          "en": "Now in this function, I want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.55,
          "end": 38.7,
          "en": "if we maybe don't have a selected location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 41.46,
          "en": "If we don't have it, hence the exclamation mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.46,
          "end": 45.023,
          "en": "I wanna tell the user that a location must you picked first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "We can do this with the alert API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 50.68,
          "en": "which is imported from React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.68,
          "end": 53.58,
          "en": "And then we could say no location picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.58,
          "end": 54.8,
          "en": "And the message could be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.8,
          "end": 59.8,
          "en": "'You have to pick a location by tapping on the map first.'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.43,
          "end": 65.48,
          "en": "So we showed this feedback and then we return to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.48,
          "end": 67.79,
          "en": "that we don't continue with the function execution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.79,
          "end": 70.35,
          "en": "if no location was picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 71.8,
          "en": "If we make it past this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.8,
          "end": 74.35,
          "en": "if check we know that we have a picked location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.35,
          "end": 79.35,
          "en": "And then of course we wanna go back to the place forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.55,
          "end": 82.1,
          "en": "So to the add place screen in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.1,
          "end": 84.083,
          "en": "where we need that location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.07,
          "end": 87.96000000000001,
          "en": "Now we can go back with help of the navigation prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.96000000000001,
          "end": 91.03,
          "en": "which we do get in this map component because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.03,
          "end": 94.923,
          "en": "this component is a screen component registered as a screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 98.77000000000001,
          "en": "So now we can use this navigation prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.77000000000001,
          "end": 102.13,
          "en": "And we could go back by calling goback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.13,
          "end": 103.88,
          "en": "But the more elegant approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.88,
          "end": 106.78999999999999,
          "en": "which allows us to also pass some data along,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.78999999999999,
          "end": 110.763,
          "en": "is to call navigate and go back to AddPlace.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.8,
          "end": 114.62,
          "en": "React navigation will automatically detect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.62,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "that this is the screen we're coming from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.72,
          "en": "and play the appropriate back navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.72,
          "end": 122.93,
          "en": "So it will automatically handle this correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.93,
          "end": 127.22,
          "en": "But by using navigate here, we can pass a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.22,
          "end": 131.46,
          "en": "to navigate, to pass some parameters to that screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.46,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "Yes, you can also do that when going back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 136.77,
          "en": "because we're still navigating from screen a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "to b or in this case, maybe b to a.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 142.11,
          "en": "But still it's a navigation from one screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 144.97,
          "en": "to another hence, when using the navigate method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.97,
          "end": 147.993,
          "en": "we can pass some parameters along some data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.42000000000002,
          "end": 152.06,
          "en": "And here the data which I wanna pass along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.06,
          "end": 157.06,
          "en": "is my pickedlocation which is my selected location object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.16,
          "end": 161.2,
          "en": "Alternatively, we have a picked latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.2,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "which is selected location dot lat and a picked longitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.05,
          "end": 169.65,
          "en": "which is selected location dot longitude.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.65,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "And I'll use this approach here, but both would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 175.9,
          "en": "So this will now pass the data back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.9,
          "end": 178.64,
          "en": "But of course this function is never being executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.64,
          "end": 180.13,
          "en": "at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.13,
          "end": 182.89,
          "en": "It should be executed once a to be added button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.89,
          "end": 186.463,
          "en": "in the header to be added here, is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 189.54,
          "en": "And therefore we need to add this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.54,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "and then connect it to this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 195.52,
          "en": "Since this function is part of my map component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.52,
          "end": 198.84,
          "en": "and it must be part of that function because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.84,
          "end": 201.68,
          "en": "we are relying on the component state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.68,
          "end": 205.71,
          "en": "we should set our header options to add this header button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.71,
          "end": 208.82999999999998,
          "en": "from inside this map screen component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.82999999999998,
          "end": 212.1,
          "en": "And you did learn how this can be done with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.1,
          "end": 217.1,
          "en": "of use layout effect, which is imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.14,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "Use layout effect allows us to run some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 225.11,
          "en": "right when this component is rendered for the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.11,
          "end": 229.01,
          "en": "And the code I do wanna execute in here is in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.01,
          "end": 231.68,
          "en": "the code to add this header button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.68,
          "end": 234.64,
          "en": "Therefore we will access the navigation prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.64,
          "end": 239.64,
          "en": "and call setoptions and pass some options to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 243.86,
          "en": "And the option I wanna set here is the headerRight option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.86,
          "end": 245.93,
          "en": "which wants a function itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 245.93,
          "end": 248.68,
          "en": "A function where we can extract the tint color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.68,
          "end": 251.707,
          "en": "as you learned before, and where we then return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 251.707,
          "end": 254.01,
          "en": "the JSX code that should be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 254.01,
          "end": 256.07,
          "en": "on the right set of the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.07,
          "end": 259.06,
          "en": "In this case I wanna add an IcanButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.06,
          "end": 261.38,
          "en": "So that is the code I will use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.38,
          "end": 265.1,
          "en": "And of course IcanButton, in order to use it down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.1,
          "end": 268.253,
          "en": "must be imported from our components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 269.25,
          "end": 272.25,
          "en": "But then we can use it down here, and we can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.25,
          "end": 275.36,
          "en": "the Ican prop and I'll set it to save",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 275.36,
          "end": 277.853,
          "en": "which will give us a nice disc Ican.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 278.72,
          "end": 282.34000000000003,
          "en": "And then set the size to 24 maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.34000000000003,
          "end": 285.24,
          "en": "Set the color to the tint color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 285.24,
          "end": 288.03,
          "en": "we're getting from React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 288.03,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "And on press, I now want to execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 294.2,
          "en": "this savePickedLocationHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.2,
          "end": 297.269,
          "en": "So I will point at savePickedLocationHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 297.269,
          "end": 300.443,
          "en": "That is my configuration for the IcanButton here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.6,
          "end": 303.59,
          "en": "Now since this is in use layout effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 303.59,
          "end": 306.34,
          "en": "we should add all the dependencies of this effect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 306.34,
          "end": 311.34,
          "en": "And the dependencies are the navigation prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 311.82,
          "end": 314.28,
          "en": "which I'm using in this effect function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 314.28,
          "end": 319.28,
          "en": "and also the savePickedLocationHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 319.3,
          "end": 322.46,
          "en": "And since I'm passing a function here to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 322.46,
          "end": 325.17,
          "en": "a wide multiple re-render cycles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 325.17,
          "end": 328.2,
          "en": "or potentially even infinite loops,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 328.2,
          "end": 331.94,
          "en": "I will wrap this savePickedLocationHandler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 331.94,
          "end": 335.12,
          "en": "with React's use callback hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 335.12,
          "end": 337.27,
          "en": "For this I'll convert this into a constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 337.27,
          "end": 339.113,
          "en": "which holds an arrow function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 339.99,
          "end": 343.3,
          "en": "So it's still a regular function just written differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 343.3,
          "end": 346.86,
          "en": "But now we can wrap this arrow function with use callback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 347.78,
          "end": 350.92,
          "en": "which is a hook imported from React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 350.92,
          "end": 353.8,
          "en": "which helps us ensure that a function defined inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.8,
          "end": 358.05,
          "en": "of a component is not recreated unnecessarily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 358.05,
          "end": 361.43,
          "en": "For that you add a second argument to use callback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 361.43,
          "end": 363.79,
          "en": "The first argument is to function itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 363.79,
          "end": 366.09,
          "en": "The second argument is a dependency array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.09,
          "end": 367.98,
          "en": "just as in use effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 367.98,
          "end": 370.86,
          "en": "And then you can add your dependencies here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 370.86,
          "end": 373.86,
          "en": "And here the dependencies are navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 373.86,
          "end": 376.8,
          "en": "and the selectedlocation state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 376.8,
          "end": 379.67,
          "en": "So whenever the navigation prop or the selectedlocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 379.67,
          "end": 384.64,
          "en": "state value changes, this function will be recreated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 384.64,
          "end": 385.75,
          "en": "Otherwise it won't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 385.75,
          "end": 389.05,
          "en": "And this can help us improve performance a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 389.05,
          "end": 392.12,
          "en": "by avoiding unnecessary rerender cycles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.12,
          "end": 394.64,
          "en": "or even help us stop infinite loops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.64,
          "end": 397.40999999999997,
          "en": "And it is required because this function is used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 397.40999999999997,
          "end": 399.6,
          "en": "as a dependency in a number effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 399.6,
          "end": 401.75,
          "en": "And I want avoid that this effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 401.75,
          "end": 404.95,
          "en": "is re-executed unnecessarily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 404.95,
          "end": 406.53499999999997,
          "en": "With all of that out of the way though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 406.53499999999997,
          "end": 408.63,
          "en": "we are setting this option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 408.63,
          "end": 410.57,
          "en": "We are adding this header button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 410.57,
          "end": 412.95,
          "en": "And this header button should take us back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 412.95,
          "end": 416.81,
          "en": "to the previous page if we save all of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 417.69,
          "end": 419.7,
          "en": "If I try hit this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 419.7,
          "end": 422.55,
          "en": "which we can see now without picking a location first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
